    ["06_开启或关闭地面材质打印"] = "06_Enable or disable ground material printing",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It seems like it's not very warm inside one family's house...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, go to {Location:[金秋湖(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Voice Inside the House</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It seems like it's not very warm inside one family's house...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Voice Inside the House</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最后一场演出】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 \n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>乔利</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Last Performance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Tingen(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Jolly</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【理智值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n<Assistant_Title2>理智值档位：</> 理智值分为以下档位，不同档位有不同效果：\n理智值充足时，角色处于<Assistant_System>「心智锚定」（100-80）</>状态，体力消耗下降且减伤提升；降至正常水平则进入<Assistant_System>「清醒」（60-79）</>状态，该状态没有任何效果。\n\n随着理智值进一步下降，角色依次进入<Assistant_System>「心神不宁」（45-59）「自我存疑」（30-44）「低语缠身」（20-29）</>状态，行动速度与冲刺稳定性受到不同程度的削弱，周遭将出现呓语干扰。\n\n当理智值降至较低区间，角色进入<Assistant_System>「陷入疯狂」（10-19）</>状态，行动限制完全解除，伤害与受到伤害均有所提升。\n\n理智值跌至更低时，角色进入<Assistant_System>「失控边缘」（1-9）</>状态，<Assistant_System>伤害提升</>，但受到伤害同步增加，且受到的治疗效果降低，自身发出红光，视野变得疯狂。\n\n当理智值为0，并持续一定时间时，会有<Assistant_Red>恐怖</>的事情发生！"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sanity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Term Introduction: </>When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause fluctuations in the player's Sanity. As Sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the Etheric Body, Astral Body, Mental Body, and Spirit Body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence, producing corresponding effects. \n<Assistant_Title2>Sanity Tiers: </> Sanity is divided into the following tiers, each with different effects: \nWhen Sanity is sufficient, the character is in the <Assistant_System>\"Mental Anchor\" (100-80) </> state, where stamina consumption is reduced and damage reduction is increased; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Sober\" (60-79) </> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Sanity decreases further, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Restlessness\" (45-59), \"Self-Doubt\" (30-44), and \"Whispers Haunting\" (20-29) </> states in sequence. Movement speed and sprint stability are weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to a lower range, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Falling into Madness\" (10-19) </> state, where movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage taken are increased. \n\nWhen Sanity drops even lower, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Edge of Loss of Control\" (1-9) </> state, where <Assistant_System>Damage Increase </> is active, but damage taken is simultaneously increased, healing effects received are reduced, the character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\nWhen Sanity reaches 0 and remains there for a certain period, <Assistant_Red>terrifying </> things will happen!",
